      "id": "claim_838bb3be312a460fbcf70cb8a3cab28f",
      "statement": "GraphSettings.from_env() produces an immutable environment snapshot; GraphEngine, Resources, and the model gateway retain that snapshot, so editing process environment variables after construction does not change an existing runtime's behavior — a new snapshot requires reconstructing or restarting the engine.",
