      "id": "claim_c35115d5ee9541989bff3aee3b0ee300",
      "statement": "LangChainLLMGateway.chat_model selects settings.llm_model for the \"default\" tier or settings.validator_model for the \"validator\" tier (used specifically by the validate_answer structured stage), constructs ChatOpenAI with use_responses_api=False and max_retries=3, and caches each client keyed by (tier, model, requested temperature, reasoning_effort), so a settings change only takes effect through a freshly constructed gateway.",
