      "id": "claim_831dc22f95c742dba31d93c1d60c4675",
      "statement": "tests/test_model_sampling.py fixes the full model getter/fallback behavior, case-insensitive reasoning-family detection, the sampling matrix across gpt-4o/gpt-5.x/o-series models, environment-driven reasoning-effort fallback at call time, and that healthcare_rag.services.models is an identity-preserving facade over healthcare_rag.services.model_sampling; it must pass after any change to model-family or sampling logic.",
