    {
      "id": "claim_18ac02787d964c70a9bb206e17827ab5",
      "statement": "The gateway's compatibility rules (sampling_params, tier caching) only prevent an unsupported-parameter API error when swapping a model name; they do not by themselves establish a quality, latency, or cost improvement, so callers should not bypass LangChainLLMGateway with a direct ChatOpenAI construction or hard-coded sampling combination, and any performance claim needs the evaluation workflow.",
