      "id": "claim_2eaf28cf45ce41a4a2d2e727275e85d7",
      "statement": "HC_RAG_DISABLE_STAGES is a comma-separated, case-normalized ablation switch limited to safety, clarify, decompose, evaluate, validate, and followups; an unrecognized stage name raises ValueError while GraphSettings is built, and disabling the safety stage also disables the safety gate, so it must not be used as a production safety bypass.",
