    {
      "id": "claim_481016669fa5451e92e058f088b8cb5d",
      "statement": "Boolean environment controls (HC_RAG_SAFETY_GATE, HC_RAG_REFUSAL_BOUNDARY, HC_RAG_DECOMPOSE_ONLY_COMPLEX, HC_RAG_STRUCTURED_STRICT) accept case-insensitive 1/true/yes/on or 0/false/no/off, treat a blank value as the default, and raise on any other value, while HC_RAG_QUERY_RESPONSE_ARM and HC_RAG_SAFETY_CLASSIFIER are exact, case-sensitive enums that reject blank, differently-cased, or unrecognized values; HC_RAG_SAFETY_CLASSIFIER=semantic_router parses but is rejected at engine construction with SafetyClassifierUnavailableError in this build.",
      "evidence": [
